senses.gloss:
धर्मः + -अधर्मौ m. (du.) right and wrong, religion and irreligion;
 धर्माधर्मौ सपदि गलितौ पुण्यपापे विशीर्णे. ˚विद् m. a Mīmāṃsaka
 who knows the right and wrong course of action.

धर्मः + -कर्मन् n., {@-कार्यम्, -क्रिया@}
—1 any act of duty or religion, any moral or religious observance, a religious act or rite.
—2 virtuous conduct.

धारक + .{@-कः@}
—1 A vessel of any kind (box, trunk, &c.), a water-pot.
—2 A debtor.

धारक + .{@-धारिका@}
—1 A prop, pillar.
—2 A division of time (= ½ Muhūrta).
